{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And pardons, yet does not completely clear.</b> That He does not eradicate the wicked from the world, and it is like ״ויסרתיך למשפט ונקה לא אנקך״." "<b>Visiting the iniquity of fathers upon children.</b> And this is the attribute of mercy, that He does not exact punishment until the fourth generation. And in the section כי תשא, which comes to enumerate all the attributes, it is written על בני בנים, but He did not trouble to elaborate so much. And from here too you learn that ונקה לא ינקה is an attribute of mercy, since He counts it here among them."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:09:25.265576764Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}